=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Reikuu} (K-8) near Ethereal Ingress #6 in {p:Reisenjima} for a cutscene to begin the mission.
* Head to (F-5) Ethereal Ingress #4 and examine the **Babbling Brook** for a cutscene.
* Click the **Babbling Brook** again to enter Dance of the Tengu BCNM (**Zhuu Buxu**) 15 Minute fight time limit.
** Has approximately 125k HP.
** This is an Omen fight, so you will be subject to the normal Omen queue.
** Trusts may be used in the fight.
** Zhuu Buxu has access to {p:Mijin Gakure}.
*** Nii Aquu will assist and must be kept alive.
* After the fight, you'll automatically enter a cutscene.
* Click the **Babbling Brook** again to enter Dance of the Tengu BCNM (**Reikuu**) 15 Minute fight.
** Has approximately 90k HP.
** This is an Omen fight, so you will be subject to the normal Omen queue.
** Trusts may be used in the fight.
** {p:Gessho} will assist and must be kept alive.
** Both {n:Reikuu} and {p:Gessho} __can summon clones,__ and you can stagger {n:Reikuu} with a {@g:Blue} if you can damage the real one.
*** Doing so will remove all of {n:Reikuu}'s clones.
*** AoE abilities must target the real {n:Reikuu} for this to occur.
*** The clones make it difficult to target and face {n:Reikuu}.
** {n:Reikuu} also has access to {p:Mijin Gakure}.
*** It is capable of doing over 2k damage even in full -dt set. Even if all party members are KOed, Gessho can win the fight still.
* After the fight, you'll automatically enter a cutscene.
* Return to {n:Reikuu} for the final cutscene and your rewards.

=2 Notes
* At this point, you can now open up access to two new {p:Records of Eminence} objectives. See the NPC {n:Elijah} in {z:Upper Jeuno} near Home Point #1 for more information.

